Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Level 6 Constraints", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"315413b6-59df-4103-9677-c20b08a19459"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Perform the following :\n  1. Tabulates the relevant equations at \
this level.\n  2. Compute the matrix of coefficients for the level 6 \
resolvent functions.\n  3. Row - reduce the transpose of the coefficient \
matrix. \n  4. Reading off the column numbers of the first entry in each row \
indicates the linearly independent set of equations.\n   5. Find the set of \
coefficients such that you can write the linearly independent equations in \
terms of the found basis.\n   6. Eliminate level 6 resolvent functions \
leaving only constraints on lower order functions.", "Text",
  FontWeight->"Plain"],
